#: ../../configuration.rst:9
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../configuration.rst:11
msgid ""
"The connector reads its configuration from two places. The app settings "
"in the :term:`App Center` hold the settings that you need for everyday "
"operation, such as the credentials and the synchronization schedule. The "
":term:`UCR` holds the settings that control which users the connector "
"exports and how it maps their attributes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../configuration.rst:21
msgid "App settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../configuration.rst:23
msgid ""
"To open the app settings, select the app in the App Center and click "
":guilabel:`App settings`."
msgstr ""

